<title>USA: RJR Nabisco to issue $350 mln two-part debt.</title>
<headline>RJR Nabisco to issue $350 mln two-part debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>RJR Nabisco Holdings Inc is expected to issue a $350 million two-part debt offering, corporate bond syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The RJR deal is expected to include a $150 million seven-year issue as well as a $200 million 10-year issue, sources said.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanely &amp; Co Inc and Merrill Lynch &amp; Co are expected to jointly underwrite the offering, sources said.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
